    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Serve as a Beacon of the Light</p></blockquote><p>The Oath of the Holy unites Paladins who nurture life and use the power of the Light for healing and support. They combine deep piety and virtue with martial skill, aspiring to the highest standards of morality, service, and self-sacrifice.</p><p>These Paladins share the following tenets:</p><ul><li>Live your life in service to others of goodwill.</li><li>Do all in your power to ease the suffering of the innocent.</li><li>Let the Light shine through you to banish the darkness.</li></ul><h3>Oath of the Holy Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HbqaFwDXMekXCGk8]{Oath of the Holy Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bXaEm6U8XbYEiaBH]{Beacon of Light}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.2KNzm2FTmU7nW2kR]{Lightbringer's Aura}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.9CFVpiurrpL9O2ZY]{Infusion of Light}</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.geI3y0jQnGGZcim5]{Holy Deliverance}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Oath of the Holy Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHealingWor]{Healing Word}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPrayerofHe]{Prayer of Healing}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassHealin]{Mass Healing Word}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAuraofLife]{Aura of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterRes]{Greater Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
